# Project Scope: Pokemon TCG App Only

This workspace is **exclusively** for the Pokemon TCG app (Rafchu / rafchu-tcg-app).

## Strict Boundaries

- **NEVER** create, modify, or reference files related to Supercell games (Brawl Stars, Clash of Clans, Clash Royale, Squad Busters, mo.co, Boom Beach, Hay Day) or any other non-Pokemon project.
- **NEVER** commit non-project files that may appear in the workspace root.
- If you see unrelated files (e.g., Supercell docs, work files), **ignore them entirely** -- do not read, edit, commit, or mention them.
